[1] 未带 token 的请求，server 回 401
WWW-Authenticate: Bearer resource_metadata="https://books.example/.well-known/oauth-protected-resource/mcp", scope="orders:read refund:write"
[2] Protected Resource Metadata（RFC 9728）
{
 "resource": "https://books.example/mcp",
 "authorization_servers": [
  "https://auth.example"
 ],
 "scopes_supported": [
  "orders:read",
  "refund:write"
 ]
}
[3] Authorization Server Metadata（RFC 8414）
{
 "issuer": "https://auth.example",
 "authorization_endpoint": "https://auth.example/authorize",
 "token_endpoint": "https://auth.example/token",
 "code_challenge_methods_supported": [
  "S256"
 ],
 "client_id_metadata_document_supported": true,
 "authorization_response_iss_parameter_supported": true
}
[4] 选择 client_id：有预注册先用，否则 CIMD，最后 DCR
client_id: https://client.example/oauth/client.json
[5] 授权 URL: https://auth.example/authorize
    response_type = code
    client_id = https://client.example/oauth/client.json
    redirect_uri = http://127.0.0.1:8765/callback
    scope = orders:read refund:write
    state = st-7f3a9c
    code_challenge = E9Melhoa2OwvFrEMTJguCHaoeK1t8URWbuGJSstw-cM
    code_challenge_method = S256
    resource = https://books.example/mcp
[6] 回调（RFC 9207）: code=ac-4f2c8e&iss=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.example&state=st-7f3a9c
[7] 校验回调
  iss       OK
  state     OK
[8] token 请求: {
 "grant_type": "authorization_code",
 "code": "ac-4f2c8e",
 "redirect_uri": "http://127.0.0.1:8765/callback",
 "client_id": "https://client.example/oauth/client.json",
 "code_verifier": "dBjftJeZ4CVP-mB92K27uhbUJU1p1r_wW1gFWFOEjXk",
 "resource": "https://books.example/mcp"
}
[9] token 响应: aud = https://books.example/mcp
[10] 校验 token
  PKCE      OK
  resource  OK
  aud       OK
  scope     OK
全部通过: True
